R2 introduces one `LockHandle` per physical lock, with explicit acquire and release, and it owns the lock's background tasks. This is a PLAN only: write no production code. Write the plan to `/Users/raman/projects/lock_code_manager/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-11-r2-lock-handle.md` (`docs/` is gitignored and local only; never commit it).

## Base
